menu "FUSB303B Test Configuration"

    config FUSB303B_TEST_I2C_SCL
        int "I2C SCL GPIO for the test bus"
        default 33
        help
            The tests only create an I2C bus on these pins; no transfer is
            started, so any existing GPIO works. Defaults match a Candis-S31
            main I2C bus.

    config FUSB303B_TEST_I2C_SDA
        int "I2C SDA GPIO for the test bus"
        default 34
        help
            The tests only create an I2C bus on these pins; no transfer is
            started, so any existing GPIO works. Defaults match a Candis-S31
            main I2C bus.

endmenu
